SUMMARY:Nurse John LIVE at Oxnard Levity Live
DESCRIPTION:This post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you. \nOfficial Tickets\nResale Tickets \nNurse John LIVE at Oxnard Levity Live\nGet ready for a hilarious night of stand-up comedy as Nurse John brings his acclaimed “Short Staffed” tour to Oxnard Levity Live on July 16\, 2026. Known for his sharp wit and relatable humor\, Nurse John delivers a comedy experience you won’t want to miss. \nEvent Details\nDate: Thursday\, July 16\, 2026\nTime: 7:30 PM PDT\nVenue: Oxnard Levity Live\nAddress: 591 Collection Blvd\, Oxnard\, CA 93036\nAge Requirement: 21+ Event\nMinimum Purchase: Two-item minimum per person in the showroom \nAbout Nurse John\nNurse John is a rising stand-up comedian who has built a massive following with his unique blend of observational humor and storytelling. His “Short Staffed” tour has been selling out venues across the country\, bringing his signature comedic style to audiences everywhere. With a background that gives him plenty of material\, Nurse John delivers laughs that are both sharp and deeply relatable. \nWhat to Expect\n\nA full evening of stand-up comedy from one of the hottest acts on tour\nSharp\, witty material drawn from real-life experiences\nAn intimate club setting at Oxnard Levity Live\nFull bar and dining service available throughout the show\nGeneral admission seating (first-come\, first-served)\nAn unforgettable night of laughs in Oxnard\, CA\n\nVenue Information\nOxnard Levity Live is one of Southern California’s premier comedy clubs\, located at 591 Collection Blvd in Oxnard\, CA. The intimate showroom offers excellent sightlines from every seat\, full bar service\, and a two-item minimum purchase per guest. \nTicket Information\nTickets range from $43.19 to $113.80. This is a 21+ event — valid photo ID required. All sales are final. Ticket resale is strictly prohibited by the venue. \nOfficial Tickets\nResale Tickets \nThis post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you. \nAll sales are final. Show times subject to change. Valid photo ID may be required for entry.
