SUMMARY:Kiki Yeung & Esther Ku: Sweet and Sour Chicks LIVE at San Jose Improv
DESCRIPTION:Official Tickets\nResale Tickets\n\nAbout Kiki Yeung & Esther Ku\nKiki Yeung and Esther Ku are two powerhouse Asian-American stand-up comedians joining forces for their hilarious Sweet and Sour Chicks tour. Both comedians have built devoted followings through their fearless\, boundary-pushing comedy that tackles identity\, culture\, relationships\, and the absurdities of everyday life. \nEsther Ku is known for her bold\, unapologetic humor and has appeared on Comedy Central and numerous national stages. Kiki Yeung brings sharp wit and relatable storytelling to the stage\, earning acclaim for her unique perspective as an Asian-American woman in comedy. Together\, they deliver a dynamic double-bill that is both hilarious and refreshingly honest. \nEvent Details\n\nDate: Thursday\, July 16\, 2026\nTime: 8:00 PM (doors open at 7:00 PM)\nVenue: San Jose Improv\, 62 S Second St\, San Jose\, CA 95113\nNote: This is a special one-night-only event\nAge Restriction: 21+ (valid photo ID required)\n\nAbout the Venue\nThe San Jose Improv is the Bay Area’s go-to comedy destination\, nestled in the heart of downtown San Jose. This intimate club-style venue holds approximately 250 guests and is part of the iconic Improv comedy club chain that has launched the careers of countless comedy legends. \nThe venue offers a full bar and food menu\, comfortable seating with excellent sightlines\, and a lively atmosphere that makes every show feel like a special event. Conveniently located near downtown parking garages and public transit\, it’s easy to make a full night out of your visit. \nWhat to Expect\nThe Sweet and Sour Chicks show is a high-energy double-bill featuring both Kiki Yeung and Esther Ku performing their best material back-to-back. Expect sharp cultural commentary\, personal storytelling\, and plenty of laughs as these two comedians play off each other’s energy. \nThis is a rare opportunity to see two of the most exciting voices in Asian-American comedy on the same stage in an intimate setting. The show runs approximately 90 minutes and is not to be missed. \nTicket Information\nTickets are priced at approximately $30 – $60 depending on seating and availability. \n\nOfficial Tickets\nResale Tickets\n\nThis post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you. \nAll sales are final. Show times subject to change. Valid photo ID may be required for entry.
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/kiki-yeung-esther-ku-sweet-and-sour-chicks-live-at-san-jose-improv/
LOCATION:San Jose Improv\, 62 S Second St\, San Jose\, California\, 95113\, United States
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://i.ticketweb.com/i/00/13/43/37/83_Edp.jpg?v=3
