SUMMARY:D.L. Hughley LIVE at Cobb's Comedy Club
DESCRIPTION:Official TicketsResale Tickets \nAbout the Performer\nD.L. Hughley is a comedy legend — one of the original Kings of Comedy and one of the most respected voices in stand-up. With a career spanning more than three decades\, Hughley has built a reputation for fearless\, politically charged comedy that tackles race\, culture\, and the absurdities of American life with razor-sharp wit and undeniable charisma. \nA bestselling author\, radio host\, actor\, and activist\, D.L. Hughley brings far more than just jokes to the stage. His performances are part stand-up\, part social commentary — deeply funny and deeply thought-provoking in equal measure. He has released multiple acclaimed comedy specials and continues to tour relentlessly\, delivering some of the most talked-about shows on the circuit. \nSeeing D.L. Hughley live is an experience unlike any other. His command of the stage\, his ability to read a room\, and his fearless willingness to go where other comedians won’t make every performance unforgettable. \nEvent Details\nDate: Friday\, July 17\, 2026 (also Saturday\, July 18)\nTime: 7:00 PM & 9:30 PM PDT (Fri) | 7:00 PM & 9:30 PM PDT (Sat)\nVenue: Cobb’s Comedy Club\, 915 Columbus Avenue\, San Francisco\, CA 94133\nAge Restriction: 18+ / 2 Beverage Minimum\nTicket Price Range: $40 – $70 \nAbout the Venue\nCobb’s Comedy Club is San Francisco’s premier stand-up destination\, located at 915 Columbus Avenue in the iconic North Beach neighborhood. With a capacity of around 400 guests\, Cobb’s offers an intimate setting where every seat delivers a great view of the stage. \nThe club features a full bar and dining service\, with cocktails\, beer\, wine\, and food available throughout the show. The classic comedy club layout — tables and chairs arranged around a central stage — creates a lively\, communal atmosphere that makes the laughs feel even bigger. \nCobb’s has hosted virtually every major name in comedy over its storied history\, and its reputation as one of the best rooms in the country is well-earned. Parking is available in nearby garages\, and the venue is easily accessible by BART and Muni. \nWhat to Expect\nD.L. Hughley performs four shows across the weekend of July 17–18\, giving fans multiple opportunities to catch this comedy icon live. Each performance is a full stand-up set — sharp\, funny\, and unapologetically honest — delivered by one of the greatest to ever do it. \nExpect big laughs\, bold takes\, and the kind of comedy that stays with you long after the show ends. The 18+ age restriction and 2-beverage minimum are in effect. Arrive early to secure a great seat and enjoy a drink before the show begins. \nTicket Information\nPrice Range: $40 – $70 (before taxes and fees)\nTickets are available through Ticketmaster (official) and VividSeats (resale). \nOfficial TicketsResale Tickets \nThis post contains affiliate links. We may earn a commission at no extra cost to you.
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/dl-hughley-live-at-cobbs-comedy-club/
LOCATION:Cobb’s Comedy Club\, 915 Columbus Avenue\, San Francisco\, California\, 94133\, United States Of America
