SUMMARY:Lucas Zelnick LIVE at Music Box at the Borgata
DESCRIPTION:This post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you. \nOfficial Tickets\nResale Tickets \nLucas Zelnick LIVE at Music Box at the Borgata\nNew York City’s sharpest rising stand-up comedian\, Lucas Zelnick\, brings his meticulously crafted\, punch-heavy comedy to the intimate Music Box at the Borgata in Atlantic City for one unforgettable night on Friday\, July 17\, 2026. Known for his viral crowd interactions and razor-sharp material\, Zelnick is one of the most exciting voices in comedy today — and this Atlantic City show is a rare chance to see him in an intimate venue setting. \nEvent Details\nDate: Friday\, July 17\, 2026\nTime: 7:30 PM ET\nVenue: Music Box at the Borgata\nAddress: One Borgata Way\, Atlantic City\, NJ 08401\nAge Requirement: All ages welcome\nParking: Available at Borgata Hotel Casino & Spa parking facilities \nAbout Lucas Zelnick\nLucas Zelnick is a New York City-born stand-up comedian whose sharp\, punch-heavy material playfully interrogates his Upper East Side upbringing. After graduating from Williams College and earning an MBA from Stanford\, he co-founded Sesh Comedy on the Lower East Side before selling it to tour nationally. His viral clips spotlight nimble crowd interactions\, yet his shows lean on meticulously built jokes and a clear comedic point of view. Zelnick has been featured on Comedy Central Stand-Up Featuring and Don’t Tell Comedy\, and regularly appears at the Comedy Cellar while headlining theaters and clubs across the country. \nWhat to Expect\n\nSharp\, punch-heavy stand-up comedy with a clear point of view\nHilarious crowd interaction and spontaneous moments\nMaterial drawn from his unique Upper East Side upbringing and Stanford MBA background\nAn intimate Music Box setting that puts you close to the action\nOne of comedy’s fastest-rising headliners at the peak of his game\nA full evening of non-stop laughs in Atlantic City’s premier comedy venue\n\nVenue Information\nThe Music Box at the Borgata is Atlantic City’s premier intimate entertainment venue\, located inside the world-class Borgata Hotel Casino & Spa at One Borgata Way. With a capacity of approximately 1\,000 guests\, the Music Box offers an up-close and personal experience that larger arenas simply can’t match. The venue features excellent sightlines\, top-tier sound and lighting\, and easy access to Borgata’s award-winning restaurants and casino floor. \nTicket Information\nTickets for Lucas Zelnick at Music Box at the Borgata start from $231 on resale markets. Official tickets are available through Ticketmaster. Secure your seats early — this intimate venue fills up fast for top comedy headliners. \nOfficial Tickets\nResale Tickets \nThis post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you. \nAll sales are final. Show times subject to change. Valid photo ID may be required for entry.
