SUMMARY:Gary Owen: No Hard Feelings Tour LIVE at The Venetian Theatre
DESCRIPTION:Official TicketsResale Tickets \nThis post contains affiliate links. We may earn a commission at no extra cost to you. \nAbout the Performer\nGary Owen is one of America’s most beloved stand-up comedians — a fearless\, high-energy performer whose no-filter storytelling\, sharp observations\, and genuine connection with audiences have made him a fan favorite for over two decades. Known as “America’s Funniest Serviceman” from his early days winning the title at the Navy’s talent competition\, Gary has built a remarkable career in stand-up\, film\, and television. \nBest known for his roles in films like Think Like a Man\, Ride Along\, and Almost Christmas\, Gary Owen brings the same authenticity and energy to his stand-up that has made him a Hollywood star. His comedy draws from his own life — growing up in Cincinnati\, his experiences in the military\, his family life\, and his unique perspective as a comedian who has always crossed cultural boundaries with ease. \nThe No Hard Feelings Tour brings Gary Owen to The Venetian Theatre for two nights — July 17 and 18 — for what promises to be an unforgettable Las Vegas comedy experience. \nEvent Details\n\nDates: Friday\, July 17 & Saturday\, July 18\, 2026\nTime: 8:30 PM\nVenue: The Venetian Theatre at The Venetian Resort\nAddress: 3355 S Las Vegas Blvd\, Las Vegas\, NV 89109\n\nAbout the Venue\nThe Venetian Theatre at The Venetian Resort is one of Las Vegas’s most celebrated entertainment venues\, located inside the iconic Venetian Resort at 3355 S Las Vegas Blvd. Seating approximately 1\,800 guests\, the theater is known for its elegant design\, excellent acoustics\, and the intimate atmosphere that makes every performance feel special. \nThe Venetian Theatre has hosted some of the biggest names in comedy and entertainment\, and its mid-size format makes it the perfect venue for a high-energy stand-up show like Gary Owen’s No Hard Feelings Tour. Every seat offers a great view of the stage\, and the venue’s warm atmosphere ensures a fantastic crowd experience. \nValet and self-parking are available at The Venetian Resort. The resort offers world-class dining\, shopping\, and casino entertainment\, making it easy to turn a Gary Owen show into a full Las Vegas night out. \nWhat to Expect\nThis is a solo stand-up performance by Gary Owen featuring material from his No Hard Feelings Tour. The show runs approximately 75–90 minutes and features Gary’s signature high-energy comedy — hilarious stories about life\, family\, relationships\, and the world around us\, delivered with the warmth and authenticity that have made him one of the most beloved comedians working today. \nGary Owen’s live shows are known for their incredible energy and the deep bond he builds with his audience. He has a rare ability to make everyone in the room feel included and seen — his comedy is both brilliantly funny and genuinely heartfelt. \nTicket Information\nPrice Range: $74 – $250 \nTickets available through Ticketmaster (official) and VividSeats (resale). Grab your seats before they sell out! \nOfficial TicketsResale Tickets
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/gary-owen-no-hard-feelings-tour-venetian-theatre-las-vegas-july/
LOCATION:The Venetian Theatre\, 3355 S Las Vegas Blvd\, Las Vegas\, NV\, 89109\, United States
