SUMMARY:Andrew Dismukes LIVE at Punch Line Philly (Saturday Show)
DESCRIPTION:Official TicketsResale Tickets \nThis post contains affiliate links. We may earn a commission at no extra cost to you. \nAbout Andrew Dismukes\nAndrew Dismukes is one of comedy’s most exciting rising talents\, widely recognized from his time as a cast member on Saturday Night Live. His ability to inhabit bizarre characters while maintaining sharp comedic timing made him a standout on the show\, and his live stand-up performances are even more impressive. \nHailing from Texas\, Dismukes brings a uniquely deadpan yet explosive energy to the stage. His comedy weaves together absurdist premises\, relatable observations\, and unexpected twists that keep audiences laughing throughout the entire set. \nSaturday nights at Punch Line Philly are always electric\, and Andrew Dismukes is the perfect headliner to make this one unforgettable. \nEvent Details\nDate: Saturday\, July 18\, 2026 \nShow Time: 7:00 PM \nVenue: Punch Line Philly — 33 E. Laurel Street\, Philadelphia\, PA 19123 \nAge Restrictions: 18+ (valid ID required) \nContent Warning: Adult language and themes \nAbout the Venue\nPunch Line Philly is Philadelphia’s top comedy destination\, located at 33 E. Laurel Street in the vibrant Northern Liberties neighborhood. The club seats approximately 300 guests in an intimate\, purpose-built comedy setting with excellent sightlines and acoustics from every seat. \nThe venue offers a full bar and food menu\, making it easy to enjoy a complete night out. Saturday shows at Punch Line Philly are especially popular\, drawing enthusiastic crowds ready for a great time. Parking is available nearby\, and the venue is accessible by public transit. \nPunch Line Philly has earned its reputation as one of the best comedy clubs on the East Coast\, consistently booking top-tier national talent in an atmosphere that feels both professional and welcoming. \nWhat to Expect\nThis is a solo stand-up performance by Andrew Dismukes running approximately 60–75 minutes. His Saturday show is known for being especially high-energy\, with the weekend crowd bringing an infectious enthusiasm that elevates the entire performance. \nDoors open approximately 30–45 minutes before showtime. Arrive early to secure your spot\, order a drink\, and enjoy the pre-show atmosphere. A two-drink minimum applies at most tables. \nTicket Information\nPrice Range: $52 – $112 (fees included) \nTickets are available through Ticketmaster (official) and VividSeats (resale). Saturday shows sell out fast — secure your seats now! \nOfficial TicketsResale Tickets \nThis post contains affiliate links. We may earn a commission at no extra cost to you.
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/andrew-dismukes-live-at-punch-line-philly-july-eighteen/
LOCATION:Punch Line Philly\, 33 E. Laurel Street\, Philadelphia\, PA\, 19123\, United States
